  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Taaleri Solarwind Fund III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An equity commitment of up to EUR 100 million in favour of Taaleri SolarWind  III fund (the &quot;Fund&quot;).  The Fund will seek to make equity investments in utility-scale wind and  photovoltaic solar projects, primarily entering projects at early stages  (development to ready-to-build). It will also selectively pursue investments in  battery storage facilities. The Fund will invest in Europe and the United  States, with EBRD participating solely in investments in the Bank&apos;s countries  of operations (&quot;CoOs&quot;). The CoOs targeted by the Fund are Bulgaria, Croatia,  Czech Republic, Estonia, Greece, Hungary, Latvia, Lithuania, Montenegro,  Poland, Romania, Serbia, Slovak Republic and Slovenia.</narrative>
  </description>
